--- !u!114 &725447599
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 725447598}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 83c90e794281e6c45a7e3be79a668332, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InteriorDialogueManager
  minigameScene: TowerDefense
  returnScene: WorldMap
  introLines:
  - speaker: NPC
    text: Oh good, you're here! I order packages online almost every day.
  - speaker: Player
    text: And you're getting fake delivery emails, aren't you?
  - speaker: NPC
    text: Yes! Some look exactly like Amazon or FedEx but the links go somewhere
      strange.
  - speaker: Player
    text: Scammers love impersonating delivery companies. It's very common.
  - speaker: NPC
    text: My password manager warns me but I nearly clicked one this morning!
  - speaker: Player
    text: "That's exactly what they count on \u2014 a moment of habit."
  - speaker: NPC
    text: Can you help me defend my inbox? They're coming so fast!
  - speaker: Player
    text: Let's do it. I'll show you how to stop them before they get through.
  winLines:
  - speaker: NPC
    text: You blocked all of them! That was incredible to watch.
  - speaker: Player
    text: Strong, unique passwords are your first line of defence.
  - speaker: NPC
    text: And I should never reuse them across sites, right?
  - speaker: Player
    text: "Never. Use a password manager \u2014 you already have one!"
  - speaker: NPC
    text: Thank you. I feel like I can finally stop worrying.
  loseLines:
  - speaker: NPC
    text: Oh, they got through! What do I do?
  - speaker: Player
    text: Don't panic. Want to try again? I'll explain what to watch for.
  - speaker: NPC
    text: Yes please! I can't let them win.
  npcName: Mrs. Patel
